abstract: >
  Royalty OS v0.4 is a draft specification for structuring, reviewing,
  governing, and evolving multi-layer value relationships. It extends
  the v0.3 review-support architecture into a Dynamic Value Relationship OS
  through Multi-Layer Value Graphs, Policy Modules, OS Event Logs, and
  Governance Actions. Royalty OS v0.4 does not automatically decide value,
  execute compensation, determine legal ownership, or replace human judgment.
  Instead, it provides a structured layer for traceable, reviewable,
  policy-guided, boundary-aware, and accountable value relationship governance.

